      "priorKnowledge": "HB-03 — movement and passing lanes.",
      "pathwayPosition": "Previous: HB-03 — movement and passing lanes.\nCurrent: adds the shot to the passing and movement of HB-03: the same overarm action is now aimed at a target, with a side-on stance, weight transfer, and a safe follow-through. It withholds all movement into the throw — every attempt is made from a balanced standing position — which is exactly what HB-05 adds with the three-step rhythm.\nNext: HB-05 — three-step rhythm and finish.",
