      "identity": "Full title: Handball 05 — Three-Step Rhythm and Controlled Finish\nLesson code: HB-05-EN\nSport: Handball\nSubtopic: linking movement to throwing\nAge: 12–14\nExperience: developing\nDuration: 45 minutes\nGroup: 20–30 students of all genders; adapt by ability and need\nEquipment: 12–16 soft/handballs, 30 cones, bibs, and four cone goals\nSpace: gym or flat court at least half-court size\nComplexity: intermediate",
      "purpose": "The student links a catch, up to three steps, and a controlled throw without breaking movement rhythm.",
