      "priorKnowledge": "HB-04 — accurate overarm throw.",
      "pathwayPosition": "Previous: HB-04 — accurate overarm throw.\nCurrent: joins the two halves the pathway has so far kept apart: the moving reception of HB-03 and the standing throw of HB-04 become one continuous action inside the three-step rule. It withholds any defender in the finishing lane, so the rhythm is learned unopposed — which HB-06 introduces from the defending side.\nNext: HB-06 — no-contact defence and lane control.",
      "unitContribution": "Motor: coordination, braking, direction change, accuracy. Social: communication and turn-taking. Cognitive: scanning and decisions. Tactical: spacing, support, transition. Emotional: confidence and recovery after error.",
