      "priorKnowledge": "HB-05 — three-step finish.",
      "pathwayPosition": "Previous: HB-05 — three-step finish.\nCurrent: turns the pathway around to the defending side: after five attacking lessons the student now learns the stance, the side step, and the safe distance that delay an attacker and steer them away from the centre, entirely without contact. It withholds any second defender and all help defence — every task is one against one in a marked corridor — which the 3v2 of HB-07 opens up.\nNext: HB-07 — fast transition and 3v2 advantage.",
      "unitContribution": "Motor: coordination, braking, direction change, accuracy. Social: communication and turn-taking. Cognitive: scanning and decisions. Tactical: spacing, support, transition. Emotional: confidence and recovery after error.",
