      "adaptations": "Foundation: walk, soft ball, wide target, no pressure. Intermediate: light pace and one decision. Advanced: narrow target, short time, or weak hand. Large group: six zones. Small group: 2v2. Limited space: walking play. Partial equipment: one ball per pair. Varied needs: visual cue, high-contrast mark, extra time, consistent partner, adapted range.",
